title: Start
---
<<enter Jamie left neutral>>
Jamie: Hi! I'm Jamie, freshly entered on the left. #expr:grin
<<enter Dinky right neutral>>
Dinky: And I'm Dinky. Pleased to meet you. #sfx:scream
<<move Jamie center>>
Jamie: The stage moved me to the centre while I talk. #expr:neutral
Dinky: Watch my expression change. #expr:happy
Jamie: And now we both exit. #expr:sad
<<exit Dinky>>
<<exit Jamie>>
Jamie: Press R to play it again!
===
